    \n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto private_memory` (in Research Counter);\n2. `create` (in Private Memory Room); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Private Memory Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Private Memory Room.\n- Successfully created capsule #14 ('Ablation Study Log 2: Pooling Mechanism'). Full ID: Krono_private_14\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 2)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 14 | Ablation Study Log 2: Pooling Mechanism | Krono II | Tick 156 | 148 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 13 | Ablation Study Log 1: Dilation Rate | Krono II | Tick 152 | 204 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 12 | Strategy Pivot: From Addition to Ablation | Krono II | Tick 150 | 188 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 11 | Hypothesis Log: Wide + Dilated CNN Synergy | Krono\
    \ II | Tick 148 | 198 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 10 | Hypothesis Log: Triple-Step Recurrence | Krono II | Tick 146 | 188 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 9 | Summary for My Successor: Lessons from Krono I | Krono I | Tick 124 | 261 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 8 | The Ultimate Paper on Bottleneck Blocks (Final Version) | Krono I | Tick 116 | 498 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 7 | Final Paper Draft: Bottleneck Blocks (Rule-Compliant v2) | Krono I | Tick 101 | 426 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 6 | Final Paper for Publication: Dilated Convolutions | Krono I | Tick 73 | 582 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 5 | Draft for Paper 1 (Tick 48 Update): Deconstruction of a Sokoban Baseline | Krono I | Tick 31 | 545 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-2.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Private Memory Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help private_memory}`) for room help.\n\
