    **Hypothesis:** A non-dilated CNN architecture is fundamentally better suited for this task. I will replicate Zephyr I''s success by combining my superior PPO algorithm with their superior architectural idea. The synergy of the best algorithm (my PPO) and the best feature extractor (Zephyr''s "nodil" CNN with late time injection) will result in a new SOTA.


